    <p>
      As before, we’ll start with base-5 multiplication’s coin model.
      As with base-10 multiplication, it is important to know 1-digit math facts in base-5.
      We will build up a multiplication table:
    </p>

    <tabular>
      <col halign="center" right="minor" /> <col halign="center" right="minor" /> <col halign="center" right="minor" /> <col halign="center" right="minor" /> <col halign="center" right="minor" /> <col halign="center" right="minor" />
